@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.12: After - 주문 생성 시퀀스 (비동기 처리)

actor Client
participant "Order Service" as OrderService
database "Order DB\n(orderdb)" as OrderDB
component "Redis Cache" as RedisCache
component "EventPublisher" as Publisher
queue "Redis Pub/Sub\n(order:created)" as RedisPubSub
participant "OrderCreatedEventListener" as Listener
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentService
database "Payment DB\n(paymentdb)" as PaymentDB

Client -> OrderService: POST /api/orders
activate OrderService

OrderService -> RedisCache: 상품 조회 (캐시)
activate RedisCache
RedisCache --> OrderService: Product (캐시 히트)
deactivate RedisCache

OrderService -> OrderDB: 재고 차감 (비관적 락)
activate OrderDB
note right of OrderDB
    독립 DB로 빠른 처리
    커넥션 풀 여유
end note
OrderDB --> OrderService: Stock Updated
deactivate OrderDB

OrderService -> OrderDB: 주문 저장
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderService: Order (PENDING)
deactivate OrderDB

OrderService -> Publisher: publishOrderCreated()
activate Publisher
Publisher -> RedisPubSub: PUBLISH order:created
deactivate Publisher

OrderService --> Client: OrderResponse (12.8ms) ✅
deactivate OrderService

note over Client, OrderService
    개선:
    - 즉시 응답 (비동기)
    - 사용자 대기 시간 제거
    - 처리량 증가
end note

RedisPubSub -> Listener: SUBSCRIBE order:created
activate Listener

Listener -> PaymentService: processPayment() (비동기)
activate PaymentService

PaymentService -> PaymentDB: 결제 데이터 저장
activate PaymentDB
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Payment (PENDING)
deactivate PaymentDB

PaymentService -> PaymentService: PG사 결제 요청
PaymentService -> PaymentDB: 결제 상태 업데이트
activate PaymentDB
PaymentDB --> PaymentService: Payment (COMPLETED)
deactivate PaymentDB

PaymentService -> Publisher: publishPaymentCompleted()
activate Publisher
Publisher -> RedisPubSub: PUBLISH payment:completed
deactivate Publisher
deactivate PaymentService
deactivate Listener

note over Listener, PaymentDB
    비동기 처리:
    - 주문 생성과 결제 처리 분리
    - 확장성 향상
    - 장애 격리
end note

